{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264730/extras/72f94d2cbdfa80292926914320d24096.poster.avif?t=1773168778\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264730/extras/72f94d2cbdfa80292926914320d24096.webm?t=1773168778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264730/extras/72f94d2cbdfa80292926914320d24096.mp4?t=1773168778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast-paced arcade racing action in Total Arcade Racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race solo or with up to 8 players on the same screen across multiple game modes. Inspired by classic top-down racers like Super Sprint, Slicks \u2019n Slide and Super cars. Total Arcade Racing features tight controls, thrilling tracks, and non-stop fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge players from around the world in the global leaderboard. Can you claim the #1 spot in the Hall of Fame? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Cars</strong> \u2013 Each with unique speed and handling</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 Tracks</strong> \u2013 Fast, fun, and full of twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 game modes -</strong> (Arcade Race, Time trial, Championship, Elimination, Endless race, Demolition derby, Survivor, Delivery and Car Hockey)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8-Player Local Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Couch chaos at its best</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> support for 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Race for world domination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost Replays</strong> \u2013 Beat the fastest drivers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight Controls</strong> \u2013 Classic top-down racing controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party ready game \u2013 </strong>Race against your friends and family</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller &amp; Keyboard Support</strong> \u2013 Play your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264730/extras/a872d496f340b2a9d3b35f4ff7108e45.poster.avif?t=1773168778\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264730/extras/a872d496f340b2a9d3b35f4ff7108e45.webm?t=1773168778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1264730/extras/a872d496f340b2a9d3b35f4ff7108e45.mp4?t=1773168778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"6e527e2daa307ad7635b64eeb0702d83a386c399.jpg","localized_name":"All star","name":"All star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1264730/6e527e2daa307ad7635b64eeb0702d83a386c399.jpg"},{"icon":"7125f71fada94d4b24f8e74577980180d76f672a.jpg","localized_name":"Driver license","name":"Driver license","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1264730/7125f71fada94d4b24f8e74577980180d76f672a.jpg"},{"icon":"7ae3021c9cad116776c0cc552009d30cac058820.jpg","localized_name":"Best of the best","name":"Best of the best","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1264730/7ae3021c9cad116776c0cc552009d30cac058820.jpg"},{"icon":"add4ada360